From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 07:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: net: bluetooth: brcm: Add the BCM4375

The BCM4375 is the combined Wi-Fi and Bluetooth chip of the Galaxy S10
family.  Its Bluetooth side is a UART-attached Broadcom controller like the
ones already listed.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml        | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml
index 95501e858e6..4385d37d478 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/net/bluetooth/brcm,bluetooth.yaml
@@ -31,6 +31,7 @@ properties:
           - brcm,bcm43540-bt
           - brcm,bcm4335a0
           - brcm,bcm4349-bt
+          - brcm,bcm4375-bt
           - cypress,cyw4373a0-bt
           - infineon,cyw55572-bt
 
